  "title": "Westamerica Bancorporation Declares Quarterly Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "San Rafael, CA: The Board of Directors of Westamerica Bancorporation (NASDAQ: WABC) today declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.48 per share, which represents a two cent per share increase from the prior quarter, on common stock outstanding to shareholders of record at the close of business May 4, 2026. The dividend is payable May 15, […] The post Westamerica Bancorporation Declares Quarterly Cash Dividend first appeared on Westamerica Bank .",
